@startuml EquipmentRental_Management_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Equipment Rental Management (Pengurus)

actor Pengurus
participant "Dashboard" as Dash
participant System
database DB

Pengurus -> Dash: Open dashboard
Dash -> DB: Query rentals + stats
DB --> Dash: Return data
Dash --> Pengurus: Show dashboard

Pengurus -> Dash: Filter rentals
Dash -> DB: Query with filter
DB --> Dash: Return rentals
Dash --> Pengurus: Show results

Pengurus -> Dash: Click rental
Dash -> DB: Query detail
DB --> Dash: Return detail
Dash --> Pengurus: Show detail

Pengurus -> Dash: Approve pending
Dash -> System: Update status = confirmed
System -> DB: Save
System -> System: Send notification
Dash --> Pengurus: Show success

Pengurus -> Dash: Start rental
Dash -> System: Record pickup
System -> DB: Update status = in-use
Dash --> Pengurus: Show confirmation

Pengurus -> Dash: End rental
Dash -> Pengurus: Ask condition check
Pengurus -> System: Confirm + extra fees
System -> DB: Update status = returned
Dash --> Pengurus: Show receipt

Pengurus -> Dash: View reports
Dash -> DB: Aggregate data
DB --> Dash: Return analytics
Dash --> Pengurus: Show charts

@enduml
